OL,3,GNEWSAGymshark legal battle costs small
OL,4,Agym thousands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent gym says a trademark
OL,7,Fdispute with a larger fitness company
OL,8,Fhas been "deeply intimidating".
OL,10,FThe Conditioning Club (TCC) in
OL,11,FFairford, Gloucestershire, registered
OL,12,Fits name as a trademark in 2021 but was
OL,13,Fnotified in March 2025 that Gymshark
OL,14,Fintended to register the same name for
OL,15,Fone of its clothing collections.
OL,17,FJohn Watson, owner of TCC, said it
OL,18,Fwould cost him thousands to defend his
OL,19,Ftrademark and has started a fundraiser
OL,20,Fto support his case, saying: "The
OL,21,Ffinancial imbalance between us is
OL,22,Fenormous."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
