OL,3,GNEWSAGymshark legal battle costs small
OL,4,Agym thousands
OL,5,
OL,6,FGymshark declined to comment but the
OL,7,FBBC understands it is trying to come to
OL,8,Fa mutual agreement where both companies
OL,9,Fwould be able to use the trademark but
OL,10,Fin different categories.
